t_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 id=\"elementor-tab-title-2561\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2561\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">How do I create an account on Nexus Exchange?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2561\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2561\"><p>To create an account, go to <a href=\"#\"><u>www.nexus<\/u><u>tradex<\/u><u>.com<\/u><\/a>\u00a0and click <strong><b>\u201cSign Up.\u201d<\/b><\/strong><br \/>Fill in your personal details, set a secure password, and verify your email address. Once confirmed, your account will be activated.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 id=\"elementor-tab-title-2562\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2562\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">How do I get verified?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2562\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2562\"><p>Log in to your account and visit the <strong><b>\u201cVerification\u201d<\/b><\/strong>\u00a0section.<br \/>Upload a valid government-issued ID and a selfie, then follow the on-screen instructions. Verification usually takes a few hours.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 id=\"elementor-tab-title-2563\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2563\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">3.How do I buy cryptocurrency on Nexus Exchange?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2563\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2563\"><p><strong><b>. <\/b><\/strong>After verification:<\/p><p><strong><b>. <\/b><\/strong>Go to the \u201cBuy Crypto\u201d page<\/p><p><strong><b>. <\/b><\/strong>Select your desired coin and payment method<\/p><p><strong><b>. <\/b><\/strong>Enter the amount, confirm the transaction<\/p><p><strong><b>. <\/b><\/strong>Once completed, the crypto will appear in your wallet.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"application\/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\\/\\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I create an account on Nexus Exchange?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p>To create an account, go to <a href=\\\"#\\\"><u>www.nexus<\\\/u><u>tradex<\\\/u><u>.com<\\\/u><\\\/a>\\u00a0and click <strong><b>\\u201cSign Up.\\u201d<\\\/b><\\\/strong><br \\\/>Fill in your personal details, set a secure password, and verify your email address. Once confirmed, your account will be activated.<\\\/p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I get verified?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p>Log in to your account and visit the <strong><b>\\u201cVerification\\u201d<\\\/b><\\\/strong>\\u00a0section.<br \\\/>Upload a valid government-issued ID and a selfie, then follow the on-screen instructions. Verification usually takes a few hours.<\\\/p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"3.How do I buy cryptocurrency on Nexus Exchange?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><strong><b>. <\\\/b><\\\/strong>After verification:<\\\/p><p><strong><b>. <\\\/b><\\\/strong>Go to the \\u201cBuy Crypto\\u201d page<\\\/p><p><strong><b>. <\\\/b><\\\/strong>Select your desired coin and payment method<\\\/p><p><strong><b>. <\\\/b><\\\/strong>Enter the amount, confirm the transaction<\\\/p><p><strong><b>. <\\\/b><\\\/strong>Once completed, the crypto will appear in your wallet.<\\\/p>\"}}]}<\/script>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-27a4980 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"27a4980\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Managing account<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afd3a97 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion\" data-id=\"afd3a97\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 id=\"elementor-tab-title-1841\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1841\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">How do I start trading on Nexus Exchange?How do I start trading on Nexus Exchange?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1841\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1841\"><p>Head to the <strong><b>\u201cTrade\u201d<\/b><\/strong>\u00a0or <strong><b>\u201cMarkets\u201d<\/b><\/strong>\u00a0section.<br \/>Choose your trading pair (e.g., BTC\/USDT), analyze the chart, and place an order using market or limit options. Track your trades on the dashboard.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 id=\"elementor-tab-title-1842\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1842\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">2.How do I receive and send crypto on Nexus?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1842\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1842\"><p><strong><b>. <\/b><\/strong>To receive: Go to Wallet &gt; Receive, copy your wallet address or scan the QR code.<\/p><p><strong><b>. <\/b><\/strong>To send: Go to Wallet &gt; Send, input the recipient&#8217;s wallet address, amount, and confirm. Double-check the network before sending.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"application\/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\\/\\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I start trading on Nexus Exchange?How do I start trading on Nexus Exchange?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p>Head to the <strong><b>\\u201cTrade\\u201d<\\\/b><\\\/strong>\\u00a0or <strong><b>\\u201cMarkets\\u201d<\\\/b><\\\/strong>\\u00a0section.<br \\\/>Choose your trading pair (e.g., BTC\\\/USDT), analyze the chart, and place an order using market or limit options. Track your trades on the dashboard.<\\\/p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"2.How do I receive and send crypto on Nexus?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><strong><b>. <\\\/b><\\\/strong>To receive: Go to Wallet &gt; Receive, copy your wallet address or scan the QR code.<\\\/p><p><strong><b>. <\\\/b><\\\/strong>To send: Go to Wallet &gt; Send, input the recipient&#8217;s wallet address, amount, and confirm. Double-check the network before sending.<\\\/p>\"}}]}<\/script>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e4364a3\" data-id=\"e4364a3\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-486a1a1 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"486a1a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Can\u2019t Find Answer? Ask Us<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d5e67b elementor-button-align-stretch elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-form\" data-id=\"3d5e67b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;step_next_label&quot;:&quot;Next&quot;,&quot;step_previous_label&quot;:&quot;Previous&quot;,&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;button_width&quot;:&quot;100&quot;,&quot;step_type&quot;:&quot;number_text&quot;,&quot;step_icon_shape&quot;:&quot;circle&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"form.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<form class=\"elementor-form\" method=\"post\" name=\"New Form\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"post_id\" value=\"5044\"\/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_id\" value=\"3d5e67b\"\/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"referer_title\" value=\"\" \/>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-form-fields-wrapper elementor-labels-\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-type-text elemento